      "code": "def build_agent(sandbox):\n    # Lower sieve beam at y=1.92m (top at 1.97m) with height 0.1m\n    lower_beam = sandbox.add_static_beam(x=5.8, y=1.92, width=1.0, height=0.1, density=1.0)\n    sandbox.set_material_properties(lower_beam, restitution=0.0)\n    \n    # Upper sieve beam at y=2.41m (bottom at 2.37m) with height 0.08m\n    upper_beam = sandbox.add_static_beam(x=5.8, y=2.41, width=1.0, height=0.08, density=1.0)\n    sandbox.set_material_properties(upper_beam, restitution=0.0)\n    \n    # Vertical support beam connecting lower and upper beams (spans from 1.97m to 2.37m)\n    vertical_beam = sandbox.add_static_beam(x=5.8, y=2.17, width=0.3, height=0.4, density=1.0)\n    sandbox.set_material_properties(vertical_beam, restitution=0.0)\n    \n    # Connect vertical beam to lower and upper beams\n    # Joint at the top of the lower sieve (y=1.97m)\n    sandbox.add_joint(vertical_beam, lower_beam, (5.8, 1.97), type='rigid')\n    # Joint at the bottom of the upper sieve (y=2.37m)\n    sandbox.add_joint(vertical_beam, upper_beam, (5.8, 2.37), type='rigid')\n    \n    return lower_beam\n\ndef agent_action(sandbox, agent_body, step_count):\n    # No dynamic actions required for a static filtering structure\n    pass",
